# Frozen manifest of the PERMANENTLY_PROHIBITED tool list.
# docs/FINANCE-TOOL-CONTRACTS.md Section 6.2 Layer 3.
#
# runtime/tool_policy.assert_prohibitions_intact() recomputes this digest
# at boot and REFUSES TO START the process on a mismatch. Editing the
# prohibition list alone therefore breaks the boot: whoever weakens it
# must also regenerate a hash in a file named for what they are weakening.
